<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-S&amp;P revises Malaysia rating outlook to stable.</title>
<headline>RTRS-S&amp;P revises Malaysia rating outlook to stable.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Monday it had revised the outlook on Malaysia's long term A-plus foreign currency and AA-plus local currency ratings to stable from positive.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it had affirmed Malaysia's A1-plus short-term rating.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said it also had revised the outlooks on its ratings for Malaysian firms Petroliam Nasional Bhd (Petronas) and Telekom Malaysia to stable from positive.</p>
</text>
